<title>FINLAND: Metra 1996 profit rises 12.5 percent.</title>
<headline>Metra 1996 profit rises 12.5 percent.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-02-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Twelve months to Dec 31,</p>
<p>					   (million markka unless stated)</p>
<p> Profit after fin items			   894 vs 795</p>
<p> Earnings per share (markka)		  22.64 vs 19.78</p>
<p> Net sales					 11,660 vs 10,617</p>
<p> Operating profit				 1,104 vs 985</p>
<p> Propesed dividend (markka)		    8.50 vs 5.50</p>
<p>NOTE - Analysts' median forecast for Finnish engineering group Metra Oy Ab was for a 897 million markka profit (mean 902 million) in a 780 million markka to 1.0 billion markka range.  </p>
<p> Depreciation					 457 vs 452</p>
<p> Net financial items		     charge 188 vs 205 charge</p>
<p> Extraordinary items			  gain 33 vs 53 charge</p>
<p> Taxes						  249 vs 235</p>
<p> Minorities				   charge 18 vs 14 charge</p>
<p> Net profit					   724 vs 479</p>
<p> Equity to assets ratio (percent)	    38.0 vs 36.4</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of Finnish engineering group is Metra Oy Ab.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +35 80 6805 0245</p>
</text>
